## B) Install SFML

### Option 1 — **Windows + vcpkg (MSVC/Visual Studio)**
1) Install VS Build Tools (C++ workload).
2) Install vcpkg and integrate:
```powershell
git clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg
.\vcpkg\bootstrap-vcpkg.bat
.\vcpkg\vcpkg integrate install
.\vcpkg\vcpkg install sfml:x64-windows
```

### Option 2 — **Windows + MSYS2/MinGW**
```powershell
# Install MSYS2 from msys2.org, then in MSYS2 MinGW 64-bit shell:
pacman -Syu
pacman -S --needed mingw-w64-x86_64-gcc mingw-w64-x86_64-cmake mingw-w64-x86_64-ninja mingw-w64-x86_64-sfml
```

### Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)
```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install g++ cmake ninja-build libsfml-dev
```

### macOS (Homebrew)
```bash
brew install cmake ninja sfml
```

